    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The Tenro clan are fierce warriors known for their &quot;Kamitora&quot; (God-Tiger) bloodline, which grants them incredible speed, reflexes, and predatory senses. They are masters of a unique and aggressive form of Taijutsu that mimics the movements of a hunting tiger.</p><p><b>Source:</b> Mechanics/Character_Options/Occupations/Homebrew/Tenro Clan.md</p><p><b>Category:</b> Homebrew</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Age 8+</p><p><b>Class Skills:</b> Select 2 from Balance, Climb, Listen, Survival, Taijutsu.</p><p><b>Feat:</b> Select one from Advanced Bloodline (Kamitora), Brawl, Combat Martial Arts, Taijutsu Adept, Genin, Run.</p><p><b>Wealth Bonus Increase:</b> +1</p><p><b>Reputation Bonus Increase:</b> +1</p><p><b>Affiliation:</b> You require 1 less success to learn Tenro Hijutsu techniques.</p>"
